AUTOREFRESH
-----------
  streamlit-autorefresh triggers a 30s page refresh for Tab 1 live KPI data.
  Import wrapped in try/except — if pkg not installed, dashboard still works.

DOCKER VOLUME MOUNTS ADDED
---------------------------
  - ./storage    → /storage    (storage.duckdb_queries, storage.minio_client)
  - ./agents     → /agents     (agents.langgraph_app, agents.qdrant_search, etc.)
  - ./lineage    → /lineage    (lineage.openlineage_client)
  - ./mlflow     → /mlflow_scripts  (mlflow.mlflow_config for model loading)
  sys.path in app.py adds the parent of each mount (/) so `import storage.xxx` works.

FALLBACKS (all preserved)
--------------------------
  All 5 tabs maintain their graceful fallback to demo/mock data if the real
  service is not yet running. No tab can crash the dashboard.

TO RESTART STREAMLIT WITH UPDATED VOLUMES
------------------------------------------
  podman stop streamlit
  podman rm streamlit
  podman compose up -d streamlit
